WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.696
Idioms express a meaning that is not always the sum of literal words; context reveals

00:00:05.696 --> 00:00:06.429
intended use.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:11.614
Someone says “hit the books”. What do they intend? Answer: Study seriously.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.970
Explain five common idioms in different real-life scenarios.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.831
Why it works: The idiom means study.
